The roadmap is README.md; this file is not the roadmap. It states the roadmap's
headline theorems against the pinned APIs.

The algebra Tate diagonal and unique extension of Tate characters are statable.
The following headline theorems are not statable at the pins:
* sheaf Tate two-periodicity, relative Smith localization and the uniform W(k)-adic
