* normalized constant terms and their Smith/lifting comparisons lack the enhanced
  hyperbolic-localization functors;
* tilting tensor closure, character determination and bounded derived generation
  lack the algebraic highest-weight and tilting categories;
* the categorical Tate diagonal and linear Smith base change lack the convolution
